        "original_id": "a3a96322-e970-5925-9e54-486e0e4ee04e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Jumper: Griffin's Story, Jumper\n- People: Steven Gould\n- Topics: release, prequel relationship, box office performance, critical reception\n\nFacts:\n- Steven Gould released the novel Jumper: Griffin's Story on August 21, 2007.\n- Jumper: Griffin's Story was released as a prequel to the film Jumper.\n- The 2008 film Jumper ranked first at the box office in its opening weekend with $27.3 million.\n- Critics gave the film Jumper generally unfavourable reviews.\n- Critics mostly attributed Jumper's negative reception to changes from Steven Gould's novel, a rushed plot, and an anti-climactic ending.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
